OL,3,APrize-winning image which sparked
OL,4,Abacklash was AI-generated, Nikon rules
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe winner of a prestigious scientific
OL,7,Fphotography competition has been
OL,8,Fdisqualified following concerns raised
OL,9,Fby other scientists that it was fake.
OL,11,FNikon said the use of generative AI in
OL,12,Fthe composition of the video broke the
OL,13,Frules of its Small World In Motion
OL,14,Fcontest, which accepts photos and video
OL,15,Ftaken using powerful microscopes.
OL,17,FThe firm said the video "did not comply
OL,18,Fwith the competition rules regarding
OL,19,Fgenerative AI", but added it was not a
OL,20,Fjudgement of the entrant's professional
OL,21,Freputation or scientific contributions.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/18
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
